app "sky forge" {
  meta { owl: 21; description: "Build your own fighter plane: fly sorties into ever harder sectors, bring the scrap home, and spend it in the hangar on guns, armor, rockets, a shield, bombs, a magnet and a bigger engine, as much as the plane can carry"; version: "1.0"; license: "MIT"; category: "games" }
  // How it works: the flying is sky raid's (examples/sky-raid): `every frame` moves everything by
  // its speed times `dt`, the ground is a Shader, planes and letters are sprites in one palette.
  // What's new is the hangar between sorties. Scrap, the parts you own and the parts you've fitted
  // persist, so the plane grows from round to round. Three things keep it from growing too strong:
  // - Weight: every part level weighs something, and the engine carries only so much, so a plane
  //   can't have everything; the build is a choice (more guns, or armor and a shield?).
  // - Each part stops at its last level, and each level costs more than the one before.
  // - The sectors don't stop: each makes enemies 22% tougher than the last and fire a bit faster,
  //   without end, while the plane's power stops where its parts do. Scrap is worth more in later
  //   sectors, so the frontier is always where the parts come from.
  title: ""
  statusBar: false
  edge: true
  fps: mode == "play" || mode == "clear" ? 60 : 30
  icon: """<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" shape-rendering="crispEdges">
    <clipPath id="t"><rect width="256" height="256" rx="56"/></clipPath>
    <g clip-path="url(#t)"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="#3a2533"/><path fill="#46383a" d="M0 196h256v60h-256z"/><path fill="#7a6858" d="M0 196h256v6h-256zM0 224h28v6h-28zM56 224h40v6h-40zM124 224h40v6h-40zM192 224h40v6h-40z"/><path fill="#ffa940" d="M20 30h8v8h-8zM220 50h8v8h-8zM200 150h6v6h-6zM36 120h6v6h-6z"/><path fill="#0e0a0c" fill-opacity="0.35" d="M133 34h11v11h-11zM122 45h11v11h-11zM144 45h11v11h-11zM122 56h11v11h-11zM144 56h11v11h-11zM111 67h11v11h-11zM155 67h11v11h-11zM111 78h11v11h-11zM155 78h11v11h-11zM111 89h11v11h-11zM155 89h11v11h-11zM100 100h11v11h-11zM166 100h11v11h-11zM89 111h11v11h-11zM177 111h11v11h-11zM78 122h11v11h-11zM188 122h11v11h-11zM67 133h11v11h-11zM199 133h11v11h-11zM56 144h11v11h-11zM210 144h11v11h-11zM56 155h55v11h-55zM166 155h55v11h-55zM111 166h11v11h-11zM155 166h11v11h-11zM100 177h11v11h-11zM122 177h11v11h-11zM144 177h11v11h-11zM166 177h11v11h-11zM89 188h11v11h-11zM122 188h11v11h-11zM144 188h11v11h-11zM177 188h11v11h-11zM89 199h44v11h-44zM144 199h44v11h-44zM133 45h11v11h-11zM133 78h11v11h-11zM133 56h11v11h-11zM122 67h11v11h-11zM144 67h11v11h-11zM122 89h11v11h-11zM144 89h11v11h-11zM122 100h33v11h-33zM133 111h11v11h-11zM133 122h11v11h-11zM122 133h33v11h-33zM122 144h33v11h-33zM122 155h33v11h-33zM78 166h22v11h-22zM133 166h11v11h-11zM177 166h22v11h-22zM78 177h22v11h-22zM133 177h11v11h-11zM177 177h22v11h-22zM133 188h11v11h-11zM133 67h11v11h-11zM122 78h11v11h-11zM144 78h11v11h-11zM133 89h11v11h-11zM89 89h11v11h-11zM177 89h11v11h-11zM89 100h11v11h-11zM177 100h11v11h-11zM67 111h11v11h-11zM199 111h11v11h-11zM45 122h11v11h-11zM67 122h11v11h-11zM199 122h11v11h-11zM221 122h11v11h-11zM45 133h11v11h-11zM221 133h11v11h-11zM45 144h11v11h-11zM221 144h11v11h-11zM111 100h11v11h-11zM155 100h11v11h-11zM100 111h22v11h-22zM155 111h22v11h-22zM89 122h22v11h-22zM166 122h22v11h-22zM78 133h22v11h-22zM177 133h22v11h-22zM78 144h11v11h-11zM188 144h11v11h-11zM111 155h11v11h-11zM155 155h11v11h-11zM111 177h11v11h-11zM155 177h11v11h-11zM78 188h11v11h-11zM100 188h22v11h-22zM155 188h22v11h-22zM188 188h11v11h-11zM122 111h11v11h-11zM144 111h11v11h-11zM122 122h11v11h-11zM144 122h11v11h-11zM100 133h11v11h-11zM166 133h11v11h-11zM89 144h22v11h-22zM166 144h22v11h-22zM122 166h11v11h-11zM144 166h11v11h-11zM111 122h11v11h-11zM155 122h11v11h-11zM111 133h11v11h-11zM155 133h11v11h-11zM111 144h11v11h-11zM155 144h11v11h-11zM133 210h11v11h-11zM122 221h11v11h-11zM144 221h11v11h-11zM133 232h11v11h-11zM67 144h11v11h-11zM199 144h11v11h-11zM133 199h11v11h-11zM133 221h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#1d1418" d="M123 22h11v11h-11zM112 33h11v11h-11zM134 33h11v11h-11zM112 44h11v11h-11zM134 44h11v11h-11zM101 55h11v11h-11zM145 55h11v11h-11zM101 66h11v11h-11zM145 66h11v11h-11zM101 77h11v11h-11zM145 77h11v11h-11zM90 88h11v11h-11zM156 88h11v11h-11zM79 99h11v11h-11zM167 99h11v11h-11zM68 110h11v11h-11zM178 110h11v11h-11zM57 121h11v11h-11zM189 121h11v11h-11zM46 132h11v11h-11zM200 132h11v11h-11zM46 143h55v11h-55zM156 143h55v11h-55zM101 154h11v11h-11zM145 154h11v11h-11zM90 165h11v11h-11zM112 165h11v11h-11zM134 165h11v11h-11zM156 165h11v11h-11zM79 176h11v11h-11zM112 176h11v11h-11zM134 176h11v11h-11zM167 176h11v11h-11zM79 187h44v11h-44zM134 187h44v11h-44z"/><path fill="#f2e6d0" d="M123 33h11v11h-11zM123 66h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#b4a490" d="M123 44h11v11h-11zM112 55h11v11h-11zM134 55h11v11h-11zM112 77h11v11h-11zM134 77h11v11h-11zM112 88h33v11h-33zM123 99h11v11h-11zM123 110h11v11h-11zM112 121h33v11h-33zM112 132h33v11h-33zM112 143h33v11h-33zM68 154h22v11h-22zM123 154h11v11h-11zM167 154h22v11h-22zM68 165h22v11h-22zM123 165h11v11h-11zM167 165h22v11h-22zM123 176h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#7fe8d8" d="M123 55h11v11h-11zM112 66h11v11h-11zM134 66h11v11h-11zM123 77h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#46383a" d="M79 77h11v11h-11zM167 77h11v11h-11zM79 88h11v11h-11zM167 88h11v11h-11zM57 99h11v11h-11zM189 99h11v11h-11zM35 110h11v11h-11zM57 110h11v11h-11zM189 110h11v11h-11zM211 110h11v11h-11zM35 121h11v11h-11zM211 121h11v11h-11zM35 132h11v11h-11zM211 132h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#a82835" d="M101 88h11v11h-11zM145 88h11v11h-11zM90 99h22v11h-22zM145 99h22v11h-22zM79 110h22v11h-22zM156 110h22v11h-22zM68 121h22v11h-22zM167 121h22v11h-22zM68 132h11v11h-11zM178 132h11v11h-11zM101 143h11v11h-11zM145 143h11v11h-11zM101 165h11v11h-11zM145 165h11v11h-11zM68 176h11v11h-11zM90 176h22v11h-22zM145 176h22v11h-22zM178 176h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#7a6858" d="M112 99h11v11h-11zM134 99h11v11h-11zM112 110h11v11h-11zM134 110h11v11h-11zM90 121h11v11h-11zM156 121h11v11h-11zM79 132h22v11h-22zM156 132h22v11h-22zM112 154h11v11h-11zM134 154h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#e8572a" d="M101 110h11v11h-11zM145 110h11v11h-11zM101 121h11v11h-11zM145 121h11v11h-11zM101 132h11v11h-11zM145 132h11v11h-11zM123 198h11v11h-11zM112 209h11v11h-11zM134 209h11v11h-11zM123 220h11v11h-11z"/><path fill="#ffa940" d="M57 132h11v11h-11zM189 132h11v11h-11zM123 187h11v11h-11zM123 209h11v11h-11z"/></g>
  </svg>"""

  state mode = "hangar"
  // the hangar, kept between sorties: scrap to spend, each part's levels bought and fitted, the paint,
  // the sector to fly next and the furthest one cleared
  state scrap = 0 persist
  state own = [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] persist
  state fit = [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] persist
  state paint = 0 persist
  state sector = 1 persist
  state best = 0 persist
  // the sector this sortie flies: sector moves on as soon as it is cleared
  state flown = 1
  // a line under the plane that says why a tap didn't buy anything, and when it was set
  state note = ""
  state noteAt = -10
  // a sortie: the scrap it brought in so far, the hearts left, the shield, the bombs aboard
  state haul = 0
  state lost = false
  state hp = 3
  state shieldUp = false
  state shieldAt = 0
  state bombs = 0
  // time and how far the ground has scrolled, in seconds and dp
  state gt = 0
  state scroll = 0
  // the player's plane, and how far it leans into a turn
  state px = 200
  state py = 600
  state bank = 0
  state shots = []
  state rockets = []
  state eshots = []
  state foes = []
  state items = []
  state booms = []
  state scorch = []
  state pops = []
  state nextId = 0
  state fireAt = 0
  state rocketAt = 0
  state spawnAt = 0
  state bossOut = false
  state safeUntil = 0
  state bombAt = -10
  state clearAt = 0
  state overAt = 0
  // set by the store's screenshots to hold a scene still while it's drawn in each theme
  state still = false

  let W = screenWidth ?? 400
  let H = screenHeight ?? 800
  let TOP = max(screenTop ?? 0, 10)
  let BOT = screenInset ?? 0
  // one art pixel, in dp
  let P = W / 140
  let SPD = 38

  // The parts, in the hangar's order. w is what a level weighs; the engine weighs nothing and carries 5 + 2 per level.
  let PARTS = [
    {n: "GUN", w: 1, cost: [80, 200, 450, 900, 1700]},
    {n: "WING GUNS", w: 2, cost: [150, 500, 1300]},
    {n: "ARMOR", w: 1, cost: [100, 300, 700, 1500]},
    {n: "ROCKETS", w: 2, cost: [250, 700, 1600]},
    {n: "SHIELD", w: 2, cost: [200, 600, 1400]},
    {n: "BOMB BAY", w: 1, cost: [60, 200, 500]},
    {n: "MAGNET", w: 1, cost: [50, 150, 400]},
    {n: "ENGINE", w: 0, cost: [120, 350, 800, 1600, 3000]}
  ]
  let gun = clamp(fit[0] ?? 0, 0, 5)
  let wing = clamp(fit[1] ?? 0, 0, 3)
  let armor = clamp(fit[2] ?? 0, 0, 4)
  let rocket = clamp(fit[3] ?? 0, 0, 3)
  let shield = clamp(fit[4] ?? 0, 0, 3)
  let bay = clamp(fit[5] ?? 0, 0, 3)
  let magnet = clamp(fit[6] ?? 0, 0, 3)
  let engine = clamp(fit[7] ?? 0, 0, 5)
  let cap = 5 + engine * 2
  let load = sum(range(7).map(i => (fit[i] ?? 0) * PARTS[i].w))
  let maxHp = 3 + armor
  let dmg = [1, 1.25, 1.5, 1.8, 2.1, 2.5][gun]
  let rate = [0.13, 0.12, 0.11, 0.1, 0.09, 0.08][gun]
  let salvo = [0, 2, 2, 4][rocket]
  let rocketEvery = [0, 2.4, 1.6, 1.6][rocket]
  let shieldEvery = [0, 12, 9, 6][shield]
  let pull = [0, 80, 140, 220][magnet]

  let sec = mode == "hangar" ? sector : flown
  // The sector: how tough its enemies are (22% more each sector, with no end), how fast they shoot
  // and their bullets fly (both stop growing at sector 13), and what a piece of scrap is worth there.
  let diff = pow(1.22, sec - 1)
  let rof = 1 + (min(sec, 13) - 1) * 0.1
  let bs = 140 + min(sec, 13) * 12
  let chip = round(3 * (1 + (sec - 1) * 0.3))
  let LEN = 40 + min(sec, 10) * 3
  let LEVELS = [
    {name: "RUST FLATS", sea: 0.4, deep: #2c3a3a, shal: #4b5e5a, shore: #8a6a3a, low: #9a5a32, high: #6b3a26, hi: #e8a050},
    {name: "OIL DELTA", sea: 0.5, deep: #120d10, shal: #2e2430, shore: #5a4a3a, low: #6a5040, high: #46383a, hi: #ffa940},
    {name: "ASH DUNES", sea: 0.28, deep: #3a2533, shal: #5a3d4a, shore: #7a6858, low: #b4a490, high: #8a7a6a, hi: #f2e6d0},
    {name: "TOXIC MARSH", sea: 0.46, deep: #2a3a1a, shal: #6a8a2a, shore: #34402a, low: #4b5e3a, high: #2a3320, hi: #c9e265},
    {name: "MAGMA WORKS", sea: 0.42, deep: #a82835, shal: #e8572a, shore: #1d1418, low: #46383a, high: #2a1e22, hi: #ffa940}
  ]
  let lv = LEVELS[(sec - 1) % 5]
  let boss = foes.find(f => f.k == "boss")

  // The hangar's layout: the parts in rows above the fly button, the plane on show above them.
  let HROW = clamp((H - BOT - TOP - 360) / 8, 52, 60)
  let rowsTop = H - BOT - 96 - 8 * HROW
  let showP = clamp((rowsTop - 64 - TOP - 72) / 20, 3, 8)
  let showY = TOP + 72 + (rowsTop - 64 - TOP - 72 - 19 * showP) / 2 + 8.5 * showP
  let BTN = 96

  // The art: one letter per pixel, colored by PAL.
  let PAL = {B: #3f6f7a, C: #7fe8d8, D: #46383a, F: #e8572a, G: #c9e265, K: #1d1418, L: #6fb3b8, N: #3a2533, O: #e8572a, P: #4d2236, R: #a82835, S: #b4a490, T: #4b5e3a, W: #f2e6d0, Y: #ffa940, f: #ffa940, g: #7a8b3c, p: #b4a490, s: #7a6858, u: #46383a, v: #7a6858}
  let SHADOW = {B: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), C: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), D: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), F: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), G: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), K: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), L: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), N: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), O: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), P: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), R: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), S: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), T: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), W: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), Y: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), f: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), g: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), p: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.12), s: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), u: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), v: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3)}
  let FLASH = {B: #f2e6d0, C: #f2e6d0, D: #f2e6d0, F: #f2e6d0, G: #f2e6d0, K: #ffa940, L: #f2e6d0, N: #f2e6d0, O: #f2e6d0, P: #f2e6d0, R: #f2e6d0, S: #f2e6d0, T: #f2e6d0, W: #f2e6d0, Y: #f2e6d0, f: #f2e6d0, g: #f2e6d0, s: #f2e6d0, u: #f2e6d0, v: #f2e6d0}
  // The player's plane with every part on it. Letters for parts not fitted are left out of the
  // palette, so they aren't drawn: w x z the wing guns, r q the rocket pods, e E the bigger engine's
  // flame; A and a are the armor plates, steel once armored and the paint before.
  let JET = [".........K.........", "........KWK........", "........KSK........", ".......KSCSK.......", ".......KCWCK.......", ".....w.KSCSK.w.....", ".....wKBSSSBKw.....", "...x.KBBASABBK.x...", ".z.xKBBLASALBBKx.z.", ".z.KBBaLSSSLaBBK.z.", ".zKRBaaLSSSLaaBRKz.", "..KKKKKBSSSBKKKKK..", "....rr.KASAK.rr....", "....rrKBKSKBKrr....", "....qKBBKSKBBKq....", ".....KKKKfKKKK.....", ".........F.........", "........EeE........", ".........E........."]
  let PAINT = [
    {n: "TEAL", B: #3f6f7a, L: #6fb3b8, R: #a82835},
    {n: "RUST", B: #a82835, L: #e8572a, R: #ffa940},
    {n: "OLIVE", B: #4b5e3a, L: #7a8b3c, R: #ffa940},
    {n: "PLUM", B: #4d2236, L: #a82835, R: #7fe8d8},
    {n: "STEEL", B: #46383a, L: #7a6858, R: #e8572a}
  ]
  let FIGHTER = ["...KKKKKKK...", "..KPPPRPPPK..", "..KRRRRRRRK..", "...KKRRRKK...", ".KKKKRRRKKKK.", "KPPPPPRPPPPPK", "KRRRRRCRRRRRK", "KRYRRRCRRRYRK", ".KKKKRRRKKKK.", "....KRRRK....", ".....KOK.....", "..ppppppppp.."]
  let BOMBER = [".......................", ".....KKKKKKKKKKKKK.....", "....KTTTTTTTTTTTTTK....", "....KgggggggggggggK....", "....KgggggggggggggK....", ".....KKKKgggggKKKK.....", "...KKK..KgggggK..KKK...", "KKKTTTKKKgggggKKKTTTKKK", "TTTTsTTTTgggggTTTTsTTTT", "gggTsTgggggggggggTsTggg", "gWgTsTWgggggggggWTsTgWg", "gggTsTgggggGgggggTsTggg", "KKKTsTKKKggGggKKKTsTKKK", "..KTsTK.KgggggK.KTsTK..", "..KTsTK.KgggggK.KTsTK..", "..KDDDK.KggCggK.KDDDK..", "..ppppp.KggCggK.ppppp..", ".........KCCCK........."]
  let BOSS = ["................K................", ".........KKKKKKKsKKKKKKK.........", "........KDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDK........", "........KsssssssssssssssK........", "........KsssssssssssssssK........", "........KsssssssssssssssK........", ".........KKKKsssSsssKKKK.........", "............KsssSsssK............", "............KssRRRssK............", "............KssRRRssK............", "KKKKKKKKKKKKKsssSsssKKKKKKKKKKKKK", "DDDDDDDDDDDDDsssSsssDDDDDDDDDDDDD", "DDDDDDDDDDDDDsssSsssDDDDDDDDDDDDD", "ssDSDsRRDSDsssssSsssssDSDRRsDSDss", "ssDSDsRRDSDsssssSsssssDSDRRsDSDss", "ssDSDsssDSDsssssSsssssDSDsssDSDss", "sSDSDSSSDSDSSssRRRssSSDSDSSSDSDSs", "KKDSDKKKDSDKKssRRRssKKDSDKKKDSDKK", ".KDSDK.KDSDKKsssSsssKKDSDK.KDSDK.", ".KDSDK.KDSDKKsssSsssKKDSDK.KDSDK.", ".KDSDK.KDSDKKsssssssKKDSDK.KDSDK.", ".ppppp.pppppKsssssssKppppp.ppppp.", "............KsssWsssK............", "............KsCCCCCsK............", "............KsCCCCCsK............", ".............KKCCCKK............."]
  let HULL = ["KKKKKKKKKKK", "KuKTTTTTKuK", "KvKTgggTKvK", "KuKTgggTKuK", "KvKTgGgTKvK", "KuKTgggTKuK", "KvKTgggTKvK", "KuKTgggTKuK", "KvKTgggTKvK", "KuKTgggTKuK", "KvKTTTTTKvK", "KuKKKKKKKuK", "KKK.....KKK"]
  let TURRET = ["...K...", "..KSK..", "..KSK..", "..KSK..", ".KKsKK.", "KgggggK", "KgGgGgK", "KgggggK", ".KKKKK."]
  let NEST = ["...KKKKK...", ".KKYOYOYKK.", ".KYOYOYOYK.", "KYOsssssOYK", "KOsDDDDDsOK", "KYsDDDDDsYK", "KOsDDDDDsOK", "KYOsssssOYK", ".KYOYOYOYK.", ".KKYOYOYKK.", "...KKKKK..."]
  let FLAK = [".K.K.", ".S.S.", ".S.S.", ".S.S.", "KsKsK", "KDsDK", "KDsDK", ".KKK."]
  let TROOP = [[".KKK.", "KgGgK", "KgggK", "KTTTS", ".KTKS", ".K.K."], [".KKK.", "KgGgK", "KgggK", "KTTTS", ".KTKS", "K...K"]]
  let HEART = [".KK...KK.", "KRRK.KRRK", "KRWRKRRRK", "KRRRRRRRK", ".KRRRRRK.", "..KRRRK..", "...KRK...", "....K...."]
  let BOMB = [".KKKKKKK.", "KBBBBBBBK", "KBWWWWBBK", "KBWBBBWBK", "KBWWWWBBK", "KBWBBBWBK", "KBWWWWBBK", "KBBBBBBBK", ".KKKKKKK."]
  // a piece of scrap: a nut
  let NUT = [".KKK.", "KYSYK", "KSKSK", "KYSYK", ".KKK."]
  let BOOM = [[".............", ".............", ".............", ".............", ".............", ".....OO......", ".....YWY.....", ".....ORY.....", ".............", ".............", ".............", ".............", "............."], [".............", ".............", "......R......", "......OO.....", "...OOYYYO....", "...OYYWWOO...", "...OOYWWYOR..", "...ROWWWY....", "...ROYOYR....", ".....RO.R....", "......R......", ".............", "............."], [".............", "....RR.......", "...RRROROR...", "..ROOYYYOO...", "..OYYYYYYYR..", "..OOYWWYWYR..", "..RYWWWWWYR..", "..OOYWWWYOO..", "..ROYYWWOOR..", "..ROOYOYORR..", "....ROORO....", ".....RR......", "............."], [".............", ".....Ds......", "..DDDsssDD...", "..ssssOOOsD..", "..ssO..Osss..", ".DsOO...OOs..", ".sss.....Oss.", "DsssO....Os..", "..DOO..OOsss.", ".DsssOOOsss..", "...ssssssDD..", "....sDsD.D...", "............."], [".............", ".....Ds......", "...D..ss..s..", "...sss..s....", ".ss.......D..", "...........s.", ".s.........D.", "..........ssD", ".ss......DsD.", "..DD....DsD..", "..D....s.Ds..", "...ssDDDs....", ".....D......."]]
  let CLOUD = ["..............", ".....WWWW.....", "..WWWWWWWWWW..", ".WWWWWWWWWWWW.", ".SSWWWSWWWWSS.", "..SSSSSSSSSSS.", "........SS...."]
  // a 3x5 pixel font
  let FONT = {"A": ["aaa", "a.a", "aaa", "a.a", "a.a"], "B": ["aa.", "a.a", "aaa", "a.a", "aaa"], "C": ["aaa", "a..", "a..", "a..", "aaa"], "D": ["aa.", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "aa."], "E": ["aaa", "a..", "aa.", "a..", "aaa"], "F": ["aaa", "a..", "aa.", "a..", "a.."], "G": ["aaa", "a..", "a.a", "a.a", "aaa"], "H": ["a.a", "a.a", "aaa", "a.a", "a.a"], "I": ["aaa", ".a.", ".a.", ".a.", "aaa"], "J": ["..a", "..a", "..a", "a.a", ".a."], "K": ["a.a", "aa.", "a..", "aa.", "a.a"], "L": ["a..", "a..", "a..", "a..", "aaa"], "M": ["a.a", "aaa", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a"], "N": ["aaa", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a"], "O": ["aaa", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "aaa"], "P": ["aaa", "a.a", "aaa", "a..", "a.."], "Q": ["aaa", "a.a", "a.a", "aaa", "..a"], "R": ["aaa", "a.a", "aa.", "a.a", "a.a"], "S": ["aaa", "a..", "aaa", "..a", "aaa"], "T": ["aaa", ".a.", ".a.", ".a.", ".a."], "U": ["a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "aaa"], "V": ["a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a", ".a."], "W": ["a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "aaa", "a.a"], "X": ["a.a", "a.a", ".a.", "a.a", "a.a"], "Y": ["a.a", "a.a", ".a.", ".a.", ".a."], "Z": ["aaa", "..a", ".a.", "a..", "aaa"], "0": ["aaa", "a.a", "a.a", "a.a", "aaa"], "1": [".a.", "aa.", ".a.", ".a.", "aaa"], "2": ["aaa", "..a", "aaa", "a..", "aaa"], "3": ["aaa", "..a", "aaa", "..a", "aaa"], "4": ["a.a", "a.a", "aaa", "..a", "..a"], "5": ["aaa", "a..", "aaa", "..a", "aaa"], "6": ["aaa", "a..", "aaa", "a.a", "aaa"], "7": ["aaa", "..a", "..a", "..a", "..a"], "8": ["aaa", "a.a", "aaa", "a.a", "aaa"], "9": ["aaa", "a.a", "aaa", "..a", "aaa"], "-": ["...", "...", "aaa", "...", "..."], "+": ["...", ".a.", "aaa", ".a.", "..."], "!": [".a.", ".a.", ".a.", "...", ".a."], ".": ["...", "...", "...", "...", ".a."], ":": ["...", ".a.", "...", ".a.", "..."], "x": ["...", "a.a", ".a.", "a.a", "..."], "/": ["..a", "..a", ".a.", "a..", "a.."], "?": ["aa.", "..a", ".a.", "...", ".a."]}

  let flick = floor(gt * 20) % 2
  let pal = merge(PAL, {f: flick == 0 ? #ffa940 : #e8572a, F: flick == 0 ? #e8572a : #a82835, p: alpha(#b4a490, flick == 0 ? 0.9 : 0.35), u: flick == 0 ? #46383a : #7a6858, v: flick == 0 ? #7a6858 : #46383a})
  // the plane as it's built: its paint, and only the parts that are fitted
  let paintNow = PAINT[clamp(paint, 0, 4)]
  let jpal = merge(pal, {B: paintNow.B, L: paintNow.L, R: paintNow.R, A: armor >= 1 ? #7a6858 : #b4a490, a: armor >= 3 ? #7a6858 : paintNow.L},
    wing >= 1 ? {w: #46383a} : {}, wing >= 2 ? {x: #46383a} : {}, wing >= 3 ? {z: #46383a} : {},
    rocket >= 1 ? {r: #b4a490, q: #a82835} : {}, engine >= 2 ? {e: flick == 0 ? #ffa940 : #f2e6d0} : {}, engine >= 4 ? {E: flick == 0 ? #e8572a : #ffa940} : {})
  let jshadow = merge(SHADOW, {A: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), a: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3)},
    wing >= 1 ? {w: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3)} : {}, wing >= 2 ? {x: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3)} : {}, wing >= 3 ? {z: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3)} : {},
    rocket >= 1 ? {r: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3), q: alpha(#0e0a0c, 0.3)} : {})

  // What each part does at the level fitted, under its name in the hangar.
  let STAT = [
    "${fixed(dmg, 2)} DAMAGE, ${round(1 / rate)} SHOTS A SECOND",
    wing == 0 ? "MORE BARRELS, WIDER FIRE" : "${2 + 2 * wing} BARRELS",
    "${maxHp} HEARTS A SORTIE",
    rocket == 0 ? "HOMING ROCKETS" : "${salvo} EVERY ${rocketEvery} S",
    shield == 0 ? "TAKES A HIT FOR YOU" : "BACK ${shieldEvery} S AFTER A HIT",
    bay == 0 ? "BOMBS CLEAR THE SKY" : "${bay} BOMB${bay > 1 ? "S" : ""} A SORTIE",
    magnet == 0 ? "PULLS SCRAP IN" : "PULLS SCRAP FROM ${pull} DP",
    "CARRIES ${cap} LOAD"
  ]

  // Every line of text, drawn in the pixel font: s, x, y, size, color, and a from 0 (left) to 1 (right).
  let playing = mode == "play" || mode == "clear"
  let labels = (playing ? [
    {s: str(haul), x: 14 + 7 * 2.2 + 8, y: TOP + 8, p: 3.2, c: #ffa940, a: 0},
    {s: "SECTOR ${sec}", x: W / 2, y: TOP + 8, p: 2.4, c: #f2e6d0, a: 0.5}
  ] : []) + (playing && bay > 0 ? [
    {s: "x${bombs}", x: W - 30, y: H - BOT - 36, p: 2.5, c: #f2e6d0, a: 1}
  ] : []) + (mode == "play" && gt < 3.2 ? [
    {s: "SECTOR ${sec}", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.36, p: 7, c: #ffa940, a: 0.5},
    {s: lv.name, x: W / 2, y: H * 0.36 + 50, p: 4, c: #f2e6d0, a: 0.5}
  ] : []) + (mode == "play" && boss != null && boss.t < 2.5 && floor(boss.t * 4) % 2 == 0 ? [
    {s: "WARNING", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.42, p: 8, c: #a82835, a: 0.5}
  ] : []) + (mode == "clear" ? [
    {s: "SECTOR", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.34, p: 8, c: #ffa940, a: 0.5},
    {s: "CLEAR", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.34 + 54, p: 8, c: #ffa940, a: 0.5},
    {s: "BONUS +${40 * flown}", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.34 + 120, p: 3.5, c: #f2e6d0, a: 0.5}
  ] : []) + (mode == "hangar" ? [
    {s: "SKY FORGE", x: W / 2, y: TOP + 12, p: 5, c: #ffa940, a: 0.5},
    {s: str(scrap), x: 16 + 7 * 2.4 + 8, y: TOP + 50, p: 2.6, c: #ffa940, a: 0},
    {s: best > 0 ? "BEST ${best}" : "", x: W - 16, y: TOP + 50, p: 2.6, c: #b4a490, a: 1},
    {s: "LOAD ${load}/${cap}", x: 16, y: rowsTop - 30, p: 2.2, c: load >= cap ? #ffa940 : #f2e6d0, a: 0},
    {s: "FLY SECTOR ${sector}", x: W / 2, y: H - BOT - 72, p: 3.6, c: #1d1418, a: 0.5}
  ] + flatten(range(8).map(i => [[own[i] ?? 0, fit[i] ?? 0, len(PARTS[i].cost)]].map(q => [
    {s: PARTS[i].n, x: 68, y: rowsTop + i * HROW + 8, p: 2.2, c: q[1] > 0 ? #f2e6d0 : #b4a490, a: 0},
    {s: q[1] < q[0] ? "FIT" : (q[0] >= q[2] ? "MAX" : str(PARTS[i].cost[q[0]])), x: W - 16 - BTN / 2 + (q[1] < q[0] || q[0] >= q[2] ? 0 : 7), y: rowsTop + i * HROW + 8, p: 2.2,
      c: q[1] < q[0] ? (load + PARTS[i].w <= cap ? #c9e265 : #7a6858) : (q[0] >= q[2] ? #b4a490 : (scrap >= PARTS[i].cost[q[0]] && load + PARTS[i].w <= cap ? #ffa940 : #7a6858)), a: 0.5},
    {s: i < 7 && q[1] > 0 ? "-" : "", x: 16 + 22, y: rowsTop + i * HROW + (HROW - 6) / 2 - 7, p: 3, c: #f2e6d0, a: 0.5}
  ])[0])) : []) + (mode == "over" ? [
    {s: lost ? "SHOT" : "SECTOR ${flown}", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.24, p: lost ? 12 : 8, c: lost ? #a82835 : #c9e265, a: 0.5},
    {s: lost ? "DOWN" : "CLEARED", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.24 + (lost ? 76 : 56), p: lost ? 12 : 8, c: lost ? #a82835 : #c9e265, a: 0.5},
    {s: "SCRAP +${haul}", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.24 + 170, p: 4, c: #ffa940, a: 0.5},
    {s: lost ? "YOU KEEP WHAT YOU PICKED UP" : "ON TO SECTOR ${sector}", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.24 + 214, p: 2.2, c: #f2e6d0, a: 0.5},
    {s: gt - overAt > 1.2 ? "TAP FOR THE HANGAR" : "", x: W / 2, y: H * 0.62, p: 3, c: #f2e6d0, a: 0.5}
  ] : []) + pops.map(q => {s: q.s, x: q.x, y: q.y - q.t * 40, p: 2, c: q.c, a: 0.5})

  // What a frame costs to draw, in Canvas drawing calls (a sprite costs one per run of a color
  // along a row), out of 2000: past 1500 shadows are left out, and new waves wait.
  let ink = 460 + len(shots) + len(rockets) * 2 + len(eshots) * 2 + len(booms) * 40 + len(items) * 14 + len(scorch) * 30
    + sum(foes.map(f => f.k == "f" ? 56 : (f.k == "b" ? 154 : (f.k == "boss" ? 282 : (f.k == "t" ? 123 : (f.k == "g" ? 93 : 18))))))
    + sum(labels.map(l => len(l.s) * (l.p >= 3 ? 14 : 7)))
  let shadows = ink < 1500

  every frame {
    if !still {
      gt = gt + dt
      scroll = scroll + SPD * dt * (mode == "hangar" ? 0.4 : 1)
      bank = bank * pow(0.01, dt)
      booms = booms.map(b => merge(b, {t: b.t + dt, y: b.y + b.vy * dt})).filter(b => b.t < 0.62)
      scorch = scorch.map(s => merge(s, {y: s.y + SPD * dt})).filter(s => s.y < H + 60)
      pops = pops.map(q => merge(q, {t: q.t + dt})).filter(q => q.t < 1)

      // A cleared sector: after a moment, the result, then the hangar.
      if mode == "clear" && gt - clearAt > 4 {
        mode = "over"
        lost = false
        overAt = gt
      }

      // things keep flying while a sector ends and after the plane is shot down
      if mode == "play" || mode == "clear" || mode == "over" {
        shots = shots.map(b => merge(b, {x: b.x + b.vx * dt, y: b.y + b.vy * dt})).filter(b => b.y > -20 && b.x > -20 && b.x < W + 20)
        eshots = eshots.map(b => merge(b, {x: b.x + b.vx * dt, y: b.y + b.vy * dt})).filter(b => b.y > -30 && b.y < H + 30 && b.x > -30 && b.x < W + 30)
        // Rockets turn towards the nearest enemy on screen and speed up; without one they fly on.
        rockets = rockets
          .map(r => [foes.filter(f => f.y > 0 && f.x > 0 && f.x < W).sortBy(f => abs(f.x - r.x) + abs(f.y - r.y)).first()].map(tg => tg == null ? r
            : [atan2(tg.y - r.y, tg.x - r.x)].map(a => merge(r, {vx: lerp(r.vx, cos(a) * 460, min(1, 5 * dt)), vy: lerp(r.vy, sin(a) * 460, min(1, 5 * dt))}))[0])[0])
          .map(r => merge(r, {t: r.t + dt, x: r.x + r.vx * dt, y: r.y + r.vy * dt}))
          .filter(r => r.t < 3 && r.y > -30 && r.y < H + 30 && r.x > -30 && r.x < W + 30)
        // Scrap bursts out of a wreck, then drifts down; the magnet pulls it in from close enough, and
        // everything left comes to the plane when the sector is cleared.
        items = items.map(i => merge(i, {t: i.t + dt}))
          .map(i => mode == "clear" || (mode == "play" && i.k == "S" && abs(i.x - px) + abs(i.y - py) < pull)
            ? merge(i, {x: i.x + (px - i.x) * min(1, 7 * dt), y: i.y + (py - i.y) * min(1, 7 * dt)})
            : merge(i, {x: clamp(i.x + i.vx * dt, 10, W - 10), y: i.y + i.vy * dt, vx: i.vx * pow(0.15, dt), vy: lerp(i.vy, 70, min(1, 2 * dt))}))
          .filter(i => i.y < H + 30)

        // Everyone moves on their own path; the boss stops near the top and sways.
        foes = foes
          .map(f => merge(f, {t: f.t + dt, ox: f.x, oy: f.y}))
          .map(f => merge(f, {
            x: f.x0 + f.vx * f.t + sin(f.t * f.fr + f.ph) * f.amp,
            y: f.k == "boss" ? min(f.y0 + f.vy * f.t, TOP + 130) : f.y0 + f.vy * f.t + cos(f.t * f.fr + f.ph) * f.ampy
          }))
          .map(f => merge(f, {hx: f.ox < -90 ? 0 : lerp(f.hx, f.x - f.ox, 0.3), hy: f.oy < -90 ? 1 : lerp(f.hy, f.y - f.oy, 0.3)}))
          .filter(f => f.y < H + 80 && f.x > -60 - abs(f.vx) * 2 && f.x < W + 60 + abs(f.vx) * 2)
      }

      // Pick-ups: scrap goes into the hangar's store at once, so a sortie never loses what it picked up.
      if mode == "play" || mode == "clear" {
        let got = items.filter(i => abs(i.x - px) < 24 && abs(i.y - py) < 26)
        if len(got) > 0 {
          items = items.filter(i => !(abs(i.x - px) < 24 && abs(i.y - py) < 26))
          let worth = sum(got.filter(i => i.k == "S").map(i => i.v))
          haul = haul + worth
          scrap = scrap + worth
          hp = min(maxHp, hp + count(got, i => i.k == "H"))
          pops = pops + got.filter(i => i.k == "H").map(i => {x: i.x, y: i.y - 20, t: 0, s: "+1 LIFE", c: #e8572a})
        }
      }

      if mode == "play" {
        // The guns: two in the nose, and the wing guns' barrels further out, the outer ones angled.
        // fireAt is at most one shot ahead; one further ahead is from an older clock, and doesn't hold the guns
        if gt >= fireAt || fireAt - gt > 0.2 {
          let lanes = [[-1.5 * P, 0], [1.5 * P, 0]] + (wing >= 1 ? [[-4 * P, 0], [4 * P, 0]] : []) + (wing >= 2 ? [[-6 * P, -120], [6 * P, 120]] : []) + (wing >= 3 ? [[-8 * P, -280], [8 * P, 280]] : [])
          let more = shots + lanes.map((l, i) => {id: nextId + i, x: px + l[0], y: py - 20, vx: l[1], vy: -760, d: dmg})
          shots = drop(more, max(0, len(more) - 80))
          nextId = nextId + len(lanes)
          fireAt = gt + rate
        }
        // Rockets leave the pods sideways, then find their way.
        if salvo > 0 && (gt >= rocketAt || rocketAt - gt > 3) && any(foes, f => f.y > 0) {
          rockets = rockets + range(salvo).map(i => {id: nextId + i, x: px + (i % 2 == 0 ? -5 : 5) * P, y: py + 4 * P, vx: (i % 2 == 0 ? -1 : 1) * (140 + floor(i / 2) * 80), vy: -60 + floor(i / 2) * 60, t: 0, d: 6 * dmg})
          nextId = nextId + salvo
          rocketAt = gt + rocketEvery
        }
        if shield > 0 && !shieldUp && gt >= shieldAt && shieldAt - gt < 30 {
          shieldUp = true
        }
        // A new wave, sooner on later sectors, until the boss comes.
        if !bossOut && gt >= LEN {
          bossOut = true
          foes = foes + [{id: nextId, k: "boss", g: false, x0: W / 2, y0: -110, vx: 0, vy: 60, fr: 0.55, ph: 0, amp: W * 0.3, ampy: 0, t: 0, x: W / 2, y: -110, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: 120 * diff, max: 120 * diff, r: 44, fire: 1.05 / rof, fireAt: 3, drop: "H", hit: -1}]
          nextId = nextId + 1
        }
        if !bossOut && gt >= spawnAt && len(foes) < 22 && ink < 1250 {
          let roll = random()
          let pick = roll < 0.3 ? "v" : (roll < 0.48 ? "swoop" : (roll < 0.63 ? "tank" : (roll < 0.76 ? "troops" : (roll < 0.88 ? "flak" : "bomber"))))
          // Ground units need land: try a few places, with the same sines as the Shader.
          let wy = -30 - scroll
          let landX = range(6).map(i => 40 + random() * (W - 80)).find(cx => 0.5 + 0.22 * sin(cx * 0.011 + 1.7 * sin(wy * 0.006)) + 0.17 * sin(wy * 0.0093 + 1.3 * sin(cx * 0.013 + 2)) + 0.08 * sin((cx + wy) * 0.023) + 0.05 * sin((cx - wy) * 0.041 + 1) > lv.sea + 0.05)
          let ground = pick == "tank" || pick == "troops" || pick == "flak"
          let wave = ground && landX == null ? "v" : (pick == "bomber" && (gt < 12 || sec < 3) ? "swoop" : (pick == "flak" && sec < 2 ? "tank" : pick))
          let n = wave == "v" ? 5 : (wave == "swoop" ? 4 + min(3, floor(sec / 3)) : (wave == "tank" ? (sec >= 3 ? 2 : 1) : (wave == "troops" ? 6 : 1)))
          let cx = wave == "v" ? 70 + random() * (W - 140) : (landX ?? W / 2)
          let side = random() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1
          let swoopY = 70 + random() * H * 0.25
          let leaderDrop = random() < 0.15 ? "H" : ""
          foes = foes + range(n).map(i => [random()].map(r =>
            wave == "v" ? {id: nextId + i, k: "f", g: false, x0: cx + (i - 2) * 34, y0: -30 - abs(i - 2) * 24, vx: 0, vy: 120 + min(sec, 10) * 10, fr: 1.4, ph: 0, amp: 46, ampy: 0, t: 0, x: -99, y: -99, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: 2 * diff, max: 2 * diff, r: 15, fire: sec >= 2 && i % 2 == 0 ? 2.6 / rof : 0, fireAt: 0.8 + r * 1.5, drop: i == 2 ? leaderDrop : "", hit: -1}
            : (wave == "swoop" ? {id: nextId + i, k: "f", g: false, x0: side < 0 ? -30 - i * 44 : W + 30 + i * 44, y0: swoopY, vx: -side * (150 + min(sec, 10) * 10), vy: 34, fr: 2.2, ph: i * 0.6, amp: 0, ampy: 34, t: 0, x: -99, y: -99, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: 2 * diff, max: 2 * diff, r: 15, fire: sec >= 3 && i == 1 ? 1.4 : 0, fireAt: 1 + r, drop: "", hit: -1}
            : (wave == "tank" ? {id: nextId + i, k: "t", g: true, x0: clamp(cx + i * 46, 30, W - 30), y0: -30 - i * 40, vx: 0, vy: SPD, fr: 0, ph: 0, amp: 0, ampy: 0, t: 0, x: -99, y: -99, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: 6 * diff, max: 6 * diff, r: 16, fire: 2.3 / rof, fireAt: 1 + r, drop: "", hit: -1}
            : (wave == "troops" ? {id: nextId + i, k: "s", g: true, x0: cx + (i % 3) * 13 - 13, y0: -20 - floor(i / 3) * 15, vx: 0, vy: SPD, fr: 1.3, ph: i * 1.1 + (side > 0 ? 0 : 3.1), amp: 9, ampy: 0, t: 0, x: -99, y: -99, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: diff, max: diff, r: 9, fire: sec >= 2 && i % 3 == 0 ? 3.2 / rof : 0, fireAt: 1.5 + r * 2, drop: "", hit: -1}
            : (wave == "flak" ? {id: nextId + i, k: "g", g: true, x0: cx, y0: -34, vx: 0, vy: SPD, fr: 0, ph: 0, amp: 0, ampy: 0, t: 0, x: -99, y: -99, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: 10 * diff, max: 10 * diff, r: 18, fire: 2.2 / rof, fireAt: 1.2, drop: "", hit: -1}
            : {id: nextId + i, k: "b", g: false, x0: 70 + r * (W - 140), y0: -70, vx: 0, vy: 42, fr: 0.5, ph: 0, amp: 30, ampy: 0, t: 0, x: -99, y: -99, hx: 0, hy: 1, hp: 22 * diff, max: 22 * diff, r: 30, fire: 1.9 / rof, fireAt: 1.4, drop: r < 0.3 ? "H" : "", hit: -1})))))[0])
          nextId = nextId + n
          spawnAt = gt + max(0.75, (2.5 - min(sec, 12) * 0.14) * (0.7 + random() * 0.6))
        }

        // Enemy fire: aimed shots, a bomber's fan, the flak's spread, and the boss's three patterns.
        let shooters = foes.filter(f => f.fire > 0 && f.t >= f.fireAt && f.y > 30 && f.y < H * 0.7 && f.x > 0 && f.x < W)
        if len(shooters) > 0 {
          let ring = 12 + min(sec, 8) * 2
          let fresh = eshots + flatten(shooters.map(f =>
            (f.k == "boss"
              ? (floor(f.t / 3) % 3 == 0 ? range(ring).map(i => i * 6.283 / ring + f.t)
                : (floor(f.t / 3) % 3 == 1 ? [-0.36, -0.18, 0, 0.18, 0.36].map(a => a + atan2(py - f.y, px - f.x))
                  : [0, 2.094, 4.189].map(a => a + f.t * 2.3)))
              : (f.k == "b" ? [-0.6, -0.3, 0, 0.3, 0.6].map(a => a + 1.5708)
                : (f.k == "g" ? [-0.2, 0, 0.2].map(a => a + atan2(py - f.y, px - f.x)) : [atan2(py - f.y, px - f.x)])))
            .map(a => {x: f.x, y: f.y + (f.k == "boss" ? 30 : 0), vx: cos(a) * bs, vy: sin(a) * bs})
          ))
          eshots = drop(fresh, max(0, len(fresh) - 110))
          foes = foes.map(f => f.fire > 0 && f.t >= f.fireAt && f.y > 30 && f.y < H * 0.7 && f.x > 0 && f.x < W ? merge(f, {fireAt: f.t + f.fire * (f.k == "boss" && floor(f.t / 3) % 3 == 2 ? 0.3 : 0.75 + random() * 0.5)}) : f)
        }

        // Our bullets and rockets: each one that touches an enemy is spent on it, for its damage.
        let hitsBy = foes.map(f => shots.filter(b => abs(b.x - f.x) < f.r + 3 && abs(b.y - f.y) < (f.k == "boss" ? f.r * 0.8 : f.r) + 8))
        let blowsBy = foes.map(f => rockets.filter(b => abs(b.x - f.x) < f.r + 4 && abs(b.y - f.y) < (f.k == "boss" ? f.r * 0.8 : f.r) + 6))
        if any(hitsBy, h => len(h) > 0) || any(blowsBy, h => len(h) > 0) {
          let used = flatten(hitsBy).map(b => b.id)
          let spent = flatten(blowsBy)
          shots = shots.filter(b => !any(used, u => u == b.id))
          rockets = rockets.filter(b => !any(spent, u => u.id == b.id))
          let pop = booms + spent.map(b => {x: b.x, y: b.y, t: 0.1, s: 0.8, vy: 0})
          booms = drop(pop, max(0, len(pop) - 24))
          foes = foes.map((f, i) => len(hitsBy[i]) + len(blowsBy[i]) > 0 ? merge(f, {hp: f.hp - sum(hitsBy[i].map(b => b.d)) - sum(blowsBy[i].map(b => b.d)), hit: gt}) : f)
        }

        // The dead explode, leave a scorch mark on the ground, and burst into scrap.
        let dead = foes.filter(f => f.hp <= 0)
        if len(dead) > 0 {
          foes = foes.filter(f => f.hp > 0)
          let blasts = booms + flatten(dead.map(f => f.k == "boss"
            ? range(14).map(j => [random(), random()].map(r => {x: f.x + (r[0] - 0.5) * 120, y: f.y + (r[1] - 0.5) * 80, t: -j * 0.08, s: 2 + r[0] * 1.5, vy: 20})[0])
            : (f.k == "b" ? range(4).map(j => {x: f.x + (j % 2 - 0.5) * 40, y: f.y + (floor(j / 2) - 0.5) * 30, t: -j * 0.07, s: 1.6, vy: 30}) : [{x: f.x, y: f.y, t: 0, s: f.r / 12, vy: f.g ? SPD : 40}])))
          booms = drop(blasts, max(0, len(blasts) - 24))
          let marks = scorch + dead.filter(f => f.g && f.k != "s").map(f => {x: f.x, y: f.y})
          scorch = drop(marks, max(0, len(marks) - 8))
          let loot = items
            + flatten(dead.map(f => range(f.k == "boss" ? 16 : (f.k == "b" ? 6 : (f.k == "g" ? 3 : (f.k == "t" ? 2 : (f.k == "f" ? 1 : (random() < 0.4 ? 1 : 0)))))).map(j => {k: "S", v: chip, x: f.x + (random() - 0.5) * 16, y: f.y, vx: (random() - 0.5) * (f.k == "boss" ? 360 : 160), vy: -40 - random() * (f.k == "boss" ? 160 : 80), t: 0})))
            + dead.filter(f => f.drop == "H" || random() < 0.025).map(f => {k: "H", v: 0, x: f.x, y: f.y, vx: 0, vy: 20, t: 0})
          items = drop(loot, max(0, len(loot) - 45))
          if any(dead, f => f.k == "boss") {
            mode = "clear"
            clearAt = gt
            haul = haul + 40 * flown
            scrap = scrap + 40 * flown
            best = max(best, flown)
            sector = max(sector, flown + 1)
            let wreck = booms + foes.map(f => {x: f.x, y: f.y, t: -0.3, s: f.r / 12, vy: 40})
            booms = drop(wreck, max(0, len(wreck) - 30))
            foes = []
            eshots = []
            rockets = []
          }
        }

        // Hit by a bullet or a plane: the shield takes it if it's up, else a heart is gone; then a moment to get clear.
        if (gt >= safeUntil || safeUntil - gt > 2.5) && (any(eshots, b => abs(b.x - px) < 7 && abs(b.y - py) < 9) || any(foes, f => !f.g && abs(f.x - px) < f.r * 0.7 + 8 && abs(f.y - py) < f.r * 0.7 + 10)) {
          eshots = []
          if shieldUp {
            shieldUp = false
            shieldAt = gt + shieldEvery
            safeUntil = gt + 1
            pops = pops + [{x: px, y: py - 40, t: 0, s: "SHIELD", c: #7fe8d8}]
          } else {
            hp = hp - 1
            safeUntil = gt + 2.2
            let ouch = booms + [{x: px, y: py, t: 0, s: 2.2, vy: 0}, {x: px - 14, y: py + 8, t: -0.1, s: 1.2, vy: 0}, {x: px + 12, y: py - 6, t: -0.2, s: 1.2, vy: 0}]
            booms = drop(ouch, max(0, len(ouch) - 24))
            if hp <= 0 {
              mode = "over"
              lost = true
              overAt = gt
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }

  Box {
    fill: true
    background: lv.deep
    // The ground, drawn in art pixels that move with the scroll.
    Shader {
      fill: true
      fallback: lv.deep
      uniforms: {
        scroll: scroll,
        dpw: W,
        px: P,
        sea: lv.sea,
        t: gt,
        deep: lv.deep,
        shal: lv.shal,
        shore: lv.shore,
        low: lv.low,
        high: lv.high,
        hi: lv.hi
      }
      code: """
        uniform float scroll;
        uniform float dpw;
        uniform float px;
        uniform float sea;
        uniform float t;
        uniform half4 deep;
        uniform half4 shal;
        uniform half4 shore;
        uniform half4 low;
        uniform half4 high;
        uniform half4 hi;
        float hgt(float2 q) {
          return 0.5 + 0.22 * sin(q.x * 0.011 + 1.7 * sin(q.y * 0.006)) + 0.17 * sin(q.y * 0.0093 + 1.3 * sin(q.x * 0.013 + 2.0))
            + 0.08 * sin((q.x + q.y) * 0.023) + 0.05 * sin((q.x - q.y) * 0.041 + 1.0);
        }
        float rnd(float2 c) { return fract(sin(dot(c, float2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453); }
        half4 main(float2 p) {
          float2 q = p * (dpw / size.x);
          float2 cell = floor(float2(q.x, q.y - scroll) / px);
          float2 w = cell * px;
          float h = hgt(w);
          float d = h - sea;
          float n = rnd(cell);
          float chk = mod(cell.x + cell.y, 2.0);
          // light from the top left: brighter where the ground rises towards it
          float slope = hgt(w - float2(px * 2.0, px * 2.0)) - h;
          float shade = slope < -0.004 ? 1.0 : (slope > 0.004 ? -1.0 : 0.0);
          half4 c;
          if (d < -0.07 || (d < -0.05 && chk > 0.5)) {
            c = deep;
            float glint = rnd(cell + floor(t * 1.5));
            if (glint > 0.992) { c = mix(deep, hi, 0.55); }
          } else if (d < 0.0) {
            c = shal;
            if (d > -0.012 && rnd(cell + floor(t * 3.0)) > 0.5) { c = mix(shal, half4(1.0), 0.55); }
          } else if (d < 0.03 || (d < 0.04 && chk > 0.5)) {
            c = shore;
          } else if (d < 0.15 || (d < 0.17 && chk > 0.5)) {
            c = low;
            if (n > 0.93) { c = mix(low, hi, 0.6); }
            c.rgb *= half(1.0 + shade * 0.08);
          } else {
            // tree tops or rock: blobs on a three-pixel grid
            float2 m = mod(cell, 3.0);
            float tree = rnd(floor(cell / 3.0));
            c = high;
            if (m.x + m.y < 1.5 && tree > 0.3) { c = mix(high, hi, 0.35); }
            if (m.x + m.y > 3.5) { c = mix(high, half4(0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0), 0.3); }
            c.rgb *= half(1.0 + shade * 0.1);
          }
          return c;
        }
      """
    }
    Canvas {
      fill: true
      ripple: false
      // scorch marks, and cloud shadows on the ground
      for s in scorch {
        sprite(BOOM[4], s.x - 6.5 * P * 1.4, s.y - 6.5 * P * 1.4, P * 1.4, palette: {s: alpha(#1d1418, 0.5), D: alpha(#1d1418, 0.35)})
      }
      for i in range(3) {
        let lapLen = H + 420
        let at = scroll * 1.7 + i * lapLen / 3
        let cy = at % lapLen - 210
        let cx = hash(i, floor(at / lapLen)) * (W + 80) - 40 - 7 * P * 4.6
        sprite(CLOUD, cx + 34, cy + 60, P * 4.6, palette: {W: alpha(#1d1418, 0.16), S: alpha(#1d1418, 0.16)})
      }
      // ground units: tanks turn their turrets to you, flak guns their barrels, troops march
      for f in foes {
        if f.g {
          let aim = deg(atan2(px - f.x, -(py - f.y)))
          let lit = gt - f.hit < 0.06
          if f.k == "t" {
            sprite(HULL, f.x - 5.5 * P, f.y - 6.5 * P, P, palette: lit ? FLASH : pal)
            rotate(aim, f.x, f.y) { sprite(TURRET, f.x - 3.5 * P, f.y - 6.5 * P, P, palette: lit ? FLASH : pal) }
          } else if f.k == "g" {
            sprite(NEST, f.x - 5.5 * P, f.y - 5.5 * P, P, palette: lit ? FLASH : pal)
            rotate(aim, f.x, f.y) { sprite(FLAK, f.x - 2.5 * P, f.y - 6 * P, P, palette: lit ? FLASH : pal) }
          } else {
            sprite(TROOP[floor(f.t * 6 + f.id) % 2], f.x - 2.5 * P, f.y - 3 * P, P, palette: lit ? FLASH : pal)
          }
        }
      }
      // scrap and hearts to pick up
      for i in items {
        if i.k == "S" {
          rotate(i.t * 240, i.x, i.y) { sprite(NUT, i.x - 2.5 * P * 0.8, i.y - 2.5 * P * 0.8, P * 0.8, palette: pal) }
        } else {
          circle(i.x, i.y, 17 + sin(i.t * 8) * 2, fill: alpha(#e8572a, 0.3))
          sprite(HEART, i.x - 4.5 * P, i.y - 4 * P, P, palette: pal)
        }
      }
      // shadows of everything in the air, while the sky isn't too full to draw them
      for f in foes {
        if !f.g && (shadows || f.k == "boss") {
          let art = f.k == "boss" ? BOSS : (f.k == "b" ? BOMBER : FIGHTER)
          let aw = len(art[0])
          let ah = len(art)
          let sp = P * 0.8
          rotate(f.k == "f" ? deg(atan2(-f.hx, f.hy)) : 0, f.x + 8 * P, f.y + 12 * P) {
            sprite(art, f.x + 8 * P - aw * sp / 2, f.y + 12 * P - ah * sp / 2, sp, palette: SHADOW)
          }
        }
      }
      if playing {
        sprite(JET, px + 8 * P - 19 * P * 0.4, py + 14 * P - 17 * P * 0.4, P * 0.8, palette: jshadow)
      }
      // planes
      for f in foes {
        if !f.g {
          let art = f.k == "boss" ? BOSS : (f.k == "b" ? BOMBER : FIGHTER)
          let aw = len(art[0])
          let ah = len(art)
          let lit = gt - f.hit < 0.06 && (f.k != "boss" || floor(gt * 10) % 3 == 0)
          rotate(f.k == "f" ? deg(atan2(-f.hx, f.hy)) : 0, f.x, f.y) {
            sprite(art, f.x - aw * P / 2, f.y - ah * P / 2, P, palette: lit ? FLASH : pal)
          }
        }
      }
      // our bullets and rockets
      for b in shots {
        rect(b.x - 1.5, b.y - 8, 3, 14, fill: b.d >= 1.8 ? #7fe8d8 : #ffa940)
      }
      for r in rockets {
        let sp = max(1, sqrt(r.vx * r.vx + r.vy * r.vy))
        line(r.x - r.vx / sp * 14, r.y - r.vy / sp * 14, r.x - r.vx / sp * 4, r.y - r.vy / sp * 4, stroke: flick == 0 ? #ffa940 : #e8572a, width: 4, cap: round)
        line(r.x - r.vx / sp * 4, r.y - r.vy / sp * 4, r.x + r.vx / sp * 5, r.y + r.vy / sp * 5, stroke: #f2e6d0, width: 4, cap: round)
      }
      // the player's plane, leaning into turns and blinking while it can't be hit; the shield a ring around it
      if playing && (gt >= safeUntil || safeUntil - gt > 2.5 || flick == 0 || mode != "play") {
        scale(1 - abs(bank) * 0.32, 1, px, py) {
          sprite(JET, px - 9.5 * P, py - 8.5 * P, P, palette: jpal)
        }
      }
      if playing && shieldUp {
        circle(px, py + P, 13 * P, fill: alpha(#7fe8d8, 0.12))
        circle(px, py + P, 13 * P, stroke: alpha(#7fe8d8, flick == 0 ? 0.75 : 0.5), width: 2)
      }
      // enemy bullets, pulsing (circles: a sprite would cost a drawing call per run)
      for b in eshots {
        circle(b.x, b.y, 5.5, fill: #1d1418)
        circle(b.x, b.y, 3.6, fill: flick == 0 ? #e8572a : #ffa940)
      }
      // explosions
      for b in booms {
        if b.t >= 0 {
          sprite(BOOM[min(4, floor(b.t / 0.125))], b.x - 6.5 * P * b.s, b.y - 6.5 * P * b.s, P * b.s, palette: pal)
        }
      }
      // clouds over everything
      for i in range(3) {
        let lapLen = H + 420
        let at = scroll * 1.7 + i * lapLen / 3
        let cy = at % lapLen - 210
        let cx = hash(i, floor(at / lapLen)) * (W + 80) - 40 - 7 * P * 4.6
        sprite(CLOUD, cx, cy, P * 4.6, palette: {W: alpha(#f2e6d0, 0.72), S: alpha(#b4a490, 0.72)})
      }
      // a bomb's white flash
      if gt >= bombAt && gt - bombAt < 0.5 {
        rect(0, 0, W, H, fill: alpha(#f2e6d0, 0.7 * (1 - (gt - bombAt) / 0.5)))
      }
      if mode == "over" || mode == "hangar" {
        rect(0, 0, W, H, fill: alpha(#1d1418, mode == "hangar" ? 0.5 : 0.55))
      }

      // the heads-up display: scrap, hearts, the boss's health and the bomb button
      if playing {
        sprite(NUT, 14, TOP + 8, 2.2 * 1.6, palette: pal)
        for i in range(maxHp) {
          layer(i < hp ? 1 : 0.3) { sprite(HEART, W - 14 - (i + 1) * 10 * P * 0.8, TOP + 8, P * 0.8, palette: pal) }
        }
        if boss != null {
          rect(14, TOP + 52, W - 28, 8, fill: alpha(#1d1418, 0.6), radius: 2)
          rect(16, TOP + 54, (W - 32) * clamp(boss.hp / boss.max, 0, 1), 4, fill: #a82835)
        }
        if bay > 0 {
          circle(W - 62, H - BOT - 52, 34, fill: alpha(#1d1418, bombs > 0 ? 0.55 : 0.3))
          circle(W - 62, H - BOT - 52, 34, stroke: alpha(#f2e6d0, bombs > 0 ? 0.5 : 0.15), width: 2)
          layer(bombs > 0 ? 1 : 0.4) { sprite(BOMB, W - 62 - 4.5 * P * 1.4, H - BOT - 60 - 4.5 * P * 1.4, P * 1.4, palette: pal) }
        }
      }

      // The hangar: the plane on show, how much it carries, a row per part, and the fly button.
      if mode == "hangar" {
        sprite(NUT, 16, TOP + 50 - 0.5, 2.4 * 1.4, palette: pal)
        let bob = sin(gt * 1.6) * 4
        sprite(JET, W / 2 + 6 * showP - 9.5 * showP * 0.8, showY + 10 * showP - 8.5 * showP * 0.8, showP * 0.8, palette: jshadow)
        sprite(JET, W / 2 - 9.5 * showP, showY - 8.5 * showP + bob, showP, palette: jpal)
        if shield > 0 {
          circle(W / 2, showY + showP + bob, 10.5 * showP, stroke: alpha(#7fe8d8, 0.6), width: 2)
        }
        text(gt - noteAt < 2.5 && noteAt <= gt ? note : (best == 0 && sum(own) == 0 ? "FLY A SORTIE, BRING SCRAP HOME, BUILD THE PLANE" : "TAP THE PLANE TO REPAINT IT"), W / 2, rowsTop - 52, size: 11, align: center, color: gt - noteAt < 2.5 && noteAt <= gt ? #ffa940 : #b4a490, font: "mono", bold: true)
        // the load: a block per unit the engine carries, filled by what's fitted
        let segW = (W - 32 - 120) / cap
        for j in range(cap) {
          rect(16 + 120 + j * segW, rowsTop - 31, segW - 3, 12, fill: j < load ? (load >= cap ? #ffa940 : #c9e265) : alpha(#f2e6d0, 0.15), radius: 2)
        }
        for i in range(8) {
          let ry = rowsTop + i * HROW
          let o = own[i] ?? 0
          let f = fit[i] ?? 0
          let mx = len(PARTS[i].cost)
          let wt = PARTS[i].w
          rect(16, ry, W - 32, HROW - 6, fill: alpha(#1d1418, 0.78), radius: 6)
          if i < 7 {
            rect(16, ry, 44, HROW - 6, fill: alpha(#f2e6d0, f > 0 ? 0.1 : 0.03), radius: 6)
          }
          // levels: fitted, bought but left off, not bought yet
          for j in range(mx) {
            rect(68 + j * 13, ry + 24, 10, 6, fill: j < f ? #c9e265 : (j < o ? #7a6858 : alpha(#f2e6d0, 0.12)), radius: 1)
          }
          text(STAT[i], 68, ry + 38, size: 10, color: #b4a490, font: "mono")
          rect(W - 16 - BTN, ry, BTN, HROW - 6, fill: f < o ? alpha(#c9e265, 0.16) : (o >= mx ? alpha(#f2e6d0, 0.04) : (scrap >= PARTS[i].cost[o] && load + wt <= cap ? alpha(#ffa940, 0.16) : alpha(#f2e6d0, 0.06))), radius: 6)
          if f >= o && o < mx {
            sprite(NUT, W - 16 - BTN / 2 - (len(str(PARTS[i].cost[o])) * 4 - 1) * 2.2 / 2 - 7, ry + 8, 2.2, palette: pal)
          }
          text(i == 7 ? (o >= mx ? "" : "+2 LOAD") : (o >= mx && f >= o ? "" : "WEIGHS ${wt}"), W - 16 - BTN / 2, ry + 35, size: 10, align: center, color: #b4a490, font: "mono")
        }
        rect(16, H - BOT - 84, W - 32, 64, fill: #ffa940, radius: 8)
        rect(16, H - BOT - 84 + 58, W - 32, 6, fill: #e8572a, radius: 3)
        text("ENEMIES x${fixed(diff, 1)} TOUGH - SCRAP x${fixed(chip / 3, 1)}", W / 2, H - BOT - 40, size: 11, align: center, color: #4d2236, font: "mono", bold: true)
      }
      for l in labels {
        for i in range(len(l.s)) {
          let ch = sub(l.s, i, i + 1)
          let lx = l.x - (len(l.s) * 4 - 1) * l.p * l.a + i * 4 * l.p
          if ch != " " {
            if l.p >= 3 && (shadows || mode == "hangar") && l.c != #1d1418 {
              sprite(get(FONT, ch, FONT["?"]), lx + l.p / 3, l.y + l.p / 3, l.p, palette: {a: #1d1418})
            }
            sprite(get(FONT, ch, FONT["?"]), lx, l.y, l.p, palette: {a: l.c})
          }
        }
      }

      onDrag: {
        if mode == "play" || mode == "clear" {
          px = clamp(px + dx * 1.3, 18, W - 18)
          py = clamp(py + dy * 1.3, TOP + 40, H - BOT - 30)
          bank = clamp(bank + dx * 0.04, -1, 1)
        }
      }
      onTap: {
        let row = floor((y - rowsTop) / HROW)
        if mode == "over" && gt - overAt > 1.2 {
          mode = "hangar"
          foes = []
          eshots = []
          shots = []
          rockets = []
          items = []
          booms = []
          pops = []
          scorch = []
          note = ""
        } else if mode == "hangar" && y >= rowsTop && row < 8 && (y - rowsTop) % HROW < HROW - 6 && x > 16 && x < W - 16 {
          let o = own[row] ?? 0
          let f = fit[row] ?? 0
          let mx = len(PARTS[row].cost)
          let wt = PARTS[row].w
          if x < 64 {
            // take a level off: it stays bought, and can go back on for free
            if row < 7 && f > 0 {
              fit = set(fit, row, f - 1)
            }
          } else if x > W - 16 - BTN {
            if f < o {
              if load + wt <= cap {
                fit = set(fit, row, f + 1)
              } else {
                note = "TOO HEAVY: TAKE A PART OFF OR BUILD THE ENGINE UP"
                noteAt = gt
              }
            } else if o >= mx {
              note = "${PARTS[row].n} IS AS GOOD AS IT GETS"
              noteAt = gt
            } else if scrap < PARTS[row].cost[o] {
              note = "${PARTS[row].cost[o] - scrap} MORE SCRAP NEEDED"
              noteAt = gt
            } else if load + wt > cap {
              note = "TOO HEAVY: TAKE A PART OFF OR BUILD THE ENGINE UP"
              noteAt = gt
            } else {
              scrap = scrap - PARTS[row].cost[o]
              own = set(own, row, o + 1)
              fit = set(fit, row, f + 1)
              note = "${PARTS[row].n} LEVEL ${o + 1} FITTED"
              noteAt = gt
            }
          }
        } else if mode == "hangar" && y > H - BOT - 84 && y < H - BOT - 20 && x > 16 && x < W - 16 {
          mode = "play"
          flown = sector
          haul = 0
          hp = maxHp
          shieldUp = shield > 0
          shieldAt = 0
          bombs = bay
          gt = 0
          scroll = 0
          px = W / 2
          py = H * 0.78
          bank = 0
          shots = []
          rockets = []
          eshots = []
          foes = []
          items = []
          booms = []
          scorch = []
          pops = []
          fireAt = 0
          rocketAt = 2
          spawnAt = 3
          bossOut = false
          safeUntil = 2
          bombAt = -10
        } else if mode == "hangar" && y > TOP + 70 && y < rowsTop - 60 {
          paint = (paint + 1) % 5
        }
      }
    }
    // the bomb button: clears the sky of bullets and hurts everything on screen
    if playing && bay > 0 {
      Column {
        fill: true
        Spacer { weight: 1 }
        Row {
          fill: width
          padding: [0, 0, 28, BOT + 18]
          Spacer { weight: 1 }
          Box {
            width: 68
            height: 68
            radius: 34
            onPress: {
              if mode == "play" && bombs > 0 {
                bombs = bombs - 1
                bombAt = gt
                eshots = []
                foes = foes.map(f => merge(f, {hp: f.hp - (f.k == "boss" ? f.max * 0.12 : 60 * diff), hit: gt}))
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
